Here `_nominalEntries` is set by left-shifting `1` by the value of `DEFAULT_TUPLE_SKETCH_LGK` (i.e., 2 raised to that constant's power), and `_mode` is stored from the constructor argument.

## getMaxAggregatedValueByteSize() Method

